    "howToEat": "The duck is carved and you assemble each bite yourself. Lay a slice or two on a pancake, add a little sweet sauce, scallion, and cucumber, fold it like a small burrito, and eat in two bites. If pure crispy skin arrives with a dish of sugar, dip and eat it on its own, that is the chef's showpiece.",
