    "howToEat": "Dip in black vinegar, with a dab of chili oil if you like. Bite one open first to check the filling and let steam escape. Northern shops may sell by weight (a liang, 一两, is roughly five or six dumplings), and a normal solo order is two or three liang.",
    "cautiousAlternatives": [],
